/Title (The Department of Chemistry at PDEU is committed to excellence in teaching-learning and research in Chemistry and allied fields. The department consists of dynamic and dedicated faculties from premier institutes like IITs, IISc, CSIR laboratories, Central Universities, and Foreign Universities with excellent research credentials. The department is well-equipped with state-of-the-art research laboratories and high-end instrumental facilities.)
