/Title (TThe Department of Petroleum Engineering at Pandit Deendayal Energy University \(PDEU\) is committed to excellence in education, research, and innovation in the energy sector. With state-of-the-art laboratories, industry collaborations, and experienced faculty, the department provides a strong foundation in petroleum exploration, drilling, production, and reservoir engineering. Emphasizing hands-on learning, sustainability, and emerging energy technologies, the department prepares graduates to address the evolving challenges of the global energy industry.)
